import LegalLayout from '../layouts/legal-layout.astro';
---
<LegalLayout locale="en" title="About DoctorConverter" description="DoctorConverter document tools, file processing and support limits.">
  <p><strong>DoctorConverter</strong> provides online tools to convert, combine and edit PDF and office files. Core tools are currently free and do not require an account.</p>
  <h2>Choosing a tool</h2>
  <p>Different tools handle PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, JPG and PNG files; not every tool accepts every format. Each tool page shows accepted files, available options and active limits returned by the API.</p>
  <h2>How files are processed</h2>
  <p>Files upload to the server when you start processing. Local document engines process them; document contents are not sent to an external conversion API. Results are available from the same browser session. Files are stored temporarily; a delete request closes access and physical cleanup follows in the background.</p>
  <p>See the <a href="/security" class="text-accent underline">security</a> and <a href="/privacy" class="text-accent underline">privacy</a> pages for details.</p>
  <h2>Check the result</h2>
  <p>Results depend on the document. Fonts, tables and page layouts may change. Compare important information with the source before using it, and keep the original file.</p>
  <p>Follow the <a href="/use-cases/" class="text-accent underline">use-case guides</a> for task-specific steps. For questions and bug reports, use the <a href="/contact" class="text-accent underline">contact page</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
